/E (In production environments, service failures such as crashed web servers or accidentally stopped instances can cause downtime. Manual troubleshooting increases response time and operational overhead. This project addresses that problem by implementing an automated remediation pipeline that detects anomalies and fixes them automatically)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
