291 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 181 0 R
/E (The key tools I used include Amazon EC2, Amazon CloudWatch, Amazon EventBridge, AWS Lambda, Amazon SNS, AWS Systems Manager, and AWS Identity and Access Management. Key concepts I learned include building an event-driven automation workflow, monitoring infrastructure using CloudWatch alarms, triggering remediation with Lambda, and designing a self-healing system that automatically detects failures, restarts services, and sends alerts without manual intervention.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
