/P 200 0 R
/E (The pipeline was validated by intentionally stopping the nginx service and creating high CPU load using stress-ng. CloudWatch detected the anomaly, EventBridge triggered the Lambda function, and Systems Manager restarted nginx automatically. The system returned to a healthy state and a notification email confirmed the remediation. )
/Pg 34 0 R
